# CRDC Data Hub Backend Reference

## Overview

The **crdc-datahub-backend** is a Node.js 18+ / Express / GraphQL API that serves the CRDC Data Hub frontend and CLI uploader. It provides the full data submission lifecycle, batch processing, validation triggering, user management, and release workflows.

| Aspect | Detail |
|---|---|
| Runtime | Node.js 18.16.0+, Express 4.18 |
| API | GraphQL at `POST /api/graphql` |
| Database | MongoDB via Prisma ORM |
| Cloud | AWS S3, SQS (4 FIFO queues), STS, QuickSight |
| Auth | Session-based (NIH SSO) + JWT Bearer tokens (CLI) |
| Entry point | `bin/www.js` (port 4020) |
| REST endpoints | `GET /ping` (health), `GET /version` |

