## Submission Lifecycle

### Status Transitions

```
         ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │                                              │
New ──► In Progress ──► Submitted ──► Released ──► Completed ──► Archived
         │                  │            │
         │                  ▼            ▼
         │              Withdrawn    Rejected
         │                  │            │
         │                  └────────────┘
         │                       │
         ▼                       ▼
      Canceled              (can re-Submit)
```

### Actions (`submissionAction` mutation)

| Action | From Status | To Status | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Submit | In Progress, Withdrawn, Rejected | Submitted | Requires comment; checks org status, file size, validation |
| Release | Submitted | Released | Requires cross-submission validation passed |
| Withdraw | Submitted | Withdrawn | |
| Reject | Submitted | Rejected | Requires comment (Fed Lead/Admin) |
| Reject | Released | Rejected | Requires comment (Fed Lead/Admin) |
| Complete | Released | Completed | Sends SQS `Complete Submission` |
| Cancel | New, In Progress, Rejected | Canceled | Archives S3 files |
| Archive | Completed | Archived | Automated overnight job |

### Submission Properties

| Field | Values |
|---|---|
| `intention` | `New/Update` or `Delete` |
| `dataType` | `Metadata Only` or `Metadata and Data Files` |
| `dataCommons` | GC, CDS, CTDC, ICDC, CCDI, PSDC |
| `status` | New, In Progress, Submitted, Released, Completed, Archived, Canceled, Rejected, Withdrawn |
| `metadataValidationStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error |
| `fileValidationStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error |
| `crossSubmissionStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error |

### Automated Cron Jobs

| Job | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `deleteInactiveSubmissions` | Delete submissions inactive for N days, clean S3/data |
| `remindInactiveSubmission` | Send reminder emails at 7/30/60 days before expiration |
| `archiveSubmissions` | Archive completed submissions after retention period |
| `purgeDeletedDataFiles` | Remove S3 files tagged as completed beyond 180 days |
| `deleteInactiveApplications` | Delete inactive submission requests |
| `runDeactivateInactiveUsers` | Disable users inactive for N days |

