## DRS ID / file_id Generation

The backend generates deterministic file IDs using UUID v5 (namespace-based):

```javascript
_generateDataFileUUID(fileName, url, studyID, isOmitPrefix) {
    const urlUUID = v5(url, v5.URL);
    const studyUUID = v5(studyID, urlUUID);
    const fileNameUUID = v5(fileName, studyUUID);
    return isOmitPrefix ? fileNameUUID : `dg.4DFC/${fileNameUUID}`;
}
```

- `url` = `prodURL` from backend configuration (the production S3 URL)
- `studyID` = the submission's associated study ID
- Same file name + study + URL always produces the same DRS ID (deterministic)
- `omit-DCF-prefix` is read from the data model info per data commons:
  - `false` (default, GC/CDS/CTDC): `dg.4DFC/<uuid>`
  - `true` (ICDC): `<uuid>` only

