## Validation Trigger Flow

When the UI triggers validation (`validateSubmission` mutation):

```
UI: validateSubmission(_id, types=["metadata","file"], scope="New")
  │
  ├─► BE creates Validation record in MongoDB
  │
  ├─► Metadata validation:
  │     sends "Validate Metadata" to METADATA_QUEUE
  │     {type: "Validate Metadata", submissionID, scope, validationID}
  │
  ├─► Cross-submission validation:
  │     sends "Validate Cross-submission" to METADATA_QUEUE
  │     {type: "Validate Cross-submission", submissionID, validationID}
  │
  └─► File validation:
        sends "Validate File" per file node to FILE_QUEUE (batches of 300)
        {type: "Validate File", dataRecordID, validationID}
        sends "Validate Submission Files" to FILE_QUEUE
        {type: "Validate Submission Files", submissionID, validationID}
```

### SQS Queues

| Queue Config Key | Queue Name (from config) | Message Types |
|---|---|---|
| `LOADER_QUEUE` | `sqs_loader_queue` | `Load Metadata` |
| `METADATA_QUEUE` | `metadata_queue` | `Validate Metadata`, `Validate Cross-submission` |
| `FILE_QUEUE` | `file_queue` | `Validate File`, `Validate Submission Files` |
| `EXPORTER_QUEUE` | `export_queue` | `Export Metadata`, `Complete Submission` |

All queues are FIFO (`.fifo` suffix). Messages include `MessageGroupId` and `MessageDeduplicationId` (UUID v4).

### Validation Status Tracking

| Field | Values | Set By |
|---|---|---|
| `metadataValidationStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error | Backend (on trigger), Validator service (on completion) |
| `fileValidationStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error | Backend (on trigger), Validator service (on completion) |
| `crossSubmissionStatus` | New, Validating, Passed, Warning, Error | Backend (on trigger), Validator service (on completion) |

