## Authentication and PBAC

### Authentication Methods

| Method | Used By | Mechanism |
|---|---|---|
| Session-based | Browser/UI | NIH SSO via express-session + connect-mongo |
| JWT Bearer token | CLI uploader | `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header, verified against user's token whitelist |

### User Roles

| Role | Access Level |
|---|---|
| Admin | Full system access |
| Federal Lead | Review/approve submission requests, manage submissions |
| Data Commons Personnel (DCP) | Manage submissions within assigned data commons |
| Submitter | Create and manage own submissions |
| User | Read-only, can request role upgrade |

### PBAC Permission Format

```
entity:action:scope1+scope2:scopeValue1+scopeValue2
```

Examples:
- `data_submission:create:all` -- can create submissions for any study
- `data_submission:view:study:study1+study2` -- can view submissions for specific studies
- `data_submission:view:own` -- can view only own submissions

### Permission Scopes

| Scope | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `all` | Access to all resources |
| `none` | No access |
| `own` | Access to own resources only (submitter's submissions) |
| `study` | Access limited to assigned study IDs |
| `DC` | Access limited to assigned data commons |
| `role` | Access based on role-level scope values |

### Key Permissions

| Permission | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `data_submission:create` | Create submissions |
| `data_submission:view` | View submissions list and details |
| `data_submission:review` | Review/act on submissions (Fed Lead/Admin) |
| `data_submission:confirm` | Release submissions |
| `data_submission:cancel` | Cancel submissions |
| `data_submission:admin_submit` | Submit on behalf of others |
| `submission_request:create` | Create submission requests |
| `admin:manage_user` | Manage users |
| `admin:manage_studies` | Manage approved studies |
| `admin:manage_programs` | Manage programs/organizations |

