## S3 Path Structure

```
{bucketName}/
└── submissions/
    └── {submissionID}/
        ├── metadata/
        │   └── {timestamp}/     # Each metadata batch has a timestamped subfolder
        │       ├── file1.tsv
        │       └── file2.tsv
        └── file/
            ├── datafile1.csv    # Data files uploaded directly by CLI
            └── datafile2.csv
```

- `rootPath` = `submissions/{submissionID}` (set on submission creation)
- `bucketName` from program configuration or system default
- Pre-signed URLs expire after 1 hour
- STS temp credentials scoped to `arn:aws:s3:::{bucket}/{rootPath}/*` with `s3:GetObject` and `s3:PutObject`

